<text><body><div type="page" n="226"><pb n="226" facs="#f0238"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">III. Die Volksbetriebsamkeit.</fw>
<table xml:id="p226-b1" facs="#f0238-b1" rows="5" cols="8"><row role="label"><cell role="label">Landestheile.</cell><cell role="label"><name type="organism" ref="#organism-winterkorn">Winterfrucht</name>.</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"><name type="organism" ref="#organism-sommerkorn">Sommerfrucht</name>.</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label">Brache.</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"></cell></row><row role="label"><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"><name type="organism" ref="#organism-weizen">Weizen</name>.</cell><cell role="label"><name type="organism" ref="#organism-roggen">Roggen</name>.</cell><cell role="label"><name type="organism" ref="#organism-gerste">Gerste</name>.</cell><cell role="label"><name type="organism" ref="#organism-hafer">Hafer</name>.</cell><cell role="label"><name type="organism" ref="#organism-kartoffel">Kartoffeln</name>.</cell><cell role="label"><name type="organism" ref="#organism-huelsenfrucht">Hülsenfr</name>.</cell><cell role="label"><name type="organism" ref="#organism-hackfrucht">Hackfr</name>.</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName></cell><cell>1/3</cell><cell>2/3</cell><cell>1/4</cell><cell>3/4</cell><cell>1/3</cell><cell>1/9</cell><cell>5/9</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName></cell><cell>1/6</cell><cell>5/6</cell><cell>1/2</cell><cell>1/2</cell><cell>1/2</cell><cell>1/12</cell><cell>5/12</cell></row><row role="label"><cell cols="8"><placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenst.-Ebersd</placeName>.</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p226-b2"><lb n="8" facs="#f0238-l8"/>und zugleich als Ertrag nach Abzug des Saatkornes im Unterlande bei <name type="organism" ref="#organism-weizen">Weizen</name> <lb n="9" facs="#f0238-l9"/>und <name type="organism" ref="#organism-roggen">Roggen</name> sechs <note place="foot" n="*)" xml:id="p226-fn1" facs="#f0238-fn1"><lb n="42" facs="#f0238-l42"/>Genauer fünf bis sechs nach Angabe des Herrn Rittergutsbesitzers <persName ref="#person-christian-leop-herm-ampach">Ampach</persName>.</note>, bei <name type="organism" ref="#organism-gerste">Gerste</name> sieben, bei <name type="organism" ref="#organism-hafer">Hafer</name> zehn und bei <name type="organism" ref="#organism-huelsenfrucht">Hülsenfrüchten</name> <lb n="10" facs="#f0238-l10"/>vier, im Oberlande bei Halmfrüchten im Durchschnitt fünf, bei den <name type="organism" ref="#organism-kartoffel">Kartoffeln</name> <lb n="11" facs="#f0238-l11"/>aber dort und hier 40 Säcke (à Sack = 2 preußische Scheffel) und bei den <lb n="12" facs="#f0238-l12"/><name type="organism" ref="#organism-hackfrucht">Hackfrüchten</name> 125 Ctnr. (= 78 Sack) auf den Morgen in Rechnung bringen <lb n="13" facs="#f0238-l13"/>und überdies, <name type="organism" ref="#organism-roggen">Roggen</name> als Einheit gesetzt, den Nährwerth des <name type="organism" ref="#organism-weizen">Weizens</name> und <lb n="14" facs="#f0238-l14"/>der <name type="organism" ref="#organism-huelsenfrucht">Hülsenfrüchte</name> je zu 1,29, der <name type="organism" ref="#organism-gerste">Gerste</name> zu 0,76, des <name type="organism" ref="#organism-hafer">Hafers</name> zu 0,47 und der <lb n="15" facs="#f0238-l15"/><name type="organism" ref="#organism-kartoffel">Kartoffeln</name> zu 0,25 annehmen, so baut</p>
<table xml:id="p226-b3" facs="#f0238-b3" rows="10" cols="7"><row role="label"><cell role="label">Fruchtarten.</cell><cell role="label">Morgen.</cell><cell role="label">Säcke.</cell><cell role="label">Roggenwerth Ctr.</cell><cell role="label">Morgen.</cell><cell role="label">Säcke.</cell><cell role="label">Roggenwerth Ctr.</cell></row><row role="label"><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"><placeName ref="#place-gera">G e r a</placeName>.</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"><placeName ref="#place-schleiz">S c h l e i z</placeName>.</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"></cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-weizen">Weizen</name></cell><cell>5666 2/3</cell><cell>34000</cell><cell>43860</cell><cell>2273 1/3</cell><cell>11366 2/3</cell><cell>14663</cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-roggen">Korn</name></cell><cell>11333 1/3</cell><cell>68000</cell><cell>68000</cell><cell>11366 2/3</cell><cell>56832 1/3</cell><cell>56832 1/3</cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-gerste">Gerste</name></cell><cell>4250</cell><cell>29750</cell><cell>22510</cell><cell>6820</cell><cell>34100</cell><cell>25916</cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-hafer">Hafer</name></cell><cell>12750</cell><cell>127500</cell><cell>59925</cell><cell>6820</cell><cell>34100</cell><cell>16027</cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-kartoffel">Kartoffeln</name></cell><cell>5666 2/3</cell><cell>226667</cell><cell>56667</cell><cell>6820</cell><cell>272800</cell><cell>68200</cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-huelsenfrucht">Hülsenfrüchte</name></cell><cell>1888 8/9</cell><cell>7556</cell><cell>9752</cell><cell>1136 1/3</cell><cell>5681 2/3</cell><cell>7329 1/3</cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-hackfrucht">Hackfrüchte</name></cell><cell>9444 4/9</cell><cell>735667</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>5683 2/3</cell><cell>443326</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Summe</cell><cell>51000 **)</cell><cell>1229140</cell><cell>260714</cell><cell>40920 **)</cell><cell>858206 2/3</cell><cell>188967 2/3</cell></row></table>
<table xml:id="p226-b4" facs="#f0238-b4" rows="9" cols="7"><row role="label"><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"><placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-Ebersdorf</placeName>.</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label">F ü r s t e n t h u m.</cell><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"></cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-weizen">Weizen</name></cell><cell>1625</cell><cell>8125</cell><cell>10481,25</cell><cell>9565</cell><cell>53491 2/3</cell><cell>69004,25</cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-roggen">Korn</name></cell><cell>8125</cell><cell>40625</cell><cell>40625</cell><cell>30825</cell><cell>165457 1/3</cell><cell>165457,33</cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-gerste">Gerste</name></cell><cell>4875</cell><cell>24375</cell><cell>18525</cell><cell>15945</cell><cell>88225</cell><cell>66951</cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-hafer">Hafer</name></cell><cell>4875</cell><cell>24375</cell><cell>11457,25</cell><cell>24445</cell><cell>185975</cell><cell>87409,25</cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-kartoffel">Kartoffeln</name></cell><cell>4875</cell><cell>195000</cell><cell>48750</cell><cell>17361 2/3</cell><cell>694467</cell><cell>173617</cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-huelsenfrucht">Hülsenfrüchte</name></cell><cell>812 1/2</cell><cell>4062 1/2</cell><cell>5240,62</cell><cell>3837 13/18</cell><cell>17300 1/6</cell><cell>22321,95</cell></row><row><cell><name type="organism" ref="#organism-hackfrucht">Hackfrüchte</name></cell><cell>4062 1/2</cell><cell>316875</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>19190 11/18</cell><cell>1495868</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Summe</cell><cell>29250 **)</cell><cell>613437 1/2</cell><cell>135079,12</cell><cell>121170</cell><cell>2700784 1/6</cell><cell>584760,78</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p226-b5"><lb n="38" facs="#f0238-l38"/>Demnach ergiebt sich, wenn an <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-roggenwerth">Roggenwerth</rs> auf den Kopf der Bevölkerung <lb n="39" facs="#f0238-l39"/>vier, auf ein <name type="organism" ref="#organism-pferd">Pferd</name> 20, auf ein <name type="organism" ref="#organism-rind">Rind</name> 2 1/2, auf ein <name type="organism" ref="#organism-schwein">Schwein</name> 4 1/2 und auf ein <lb n="40" facs="#f0238-l40"/><name type="organism" ref="#organism-schaf">Schaf</name> und eine <name type="organism" ref="#organism-ziege">Ziege</name> 1/10 Centner gerechnet und die Consumtion mit der <lb n="41" facs="#f0238-l41"/>Production verglichen wird, folgendes Resultat:</p>
<p><note place="foot" n="**)" xml:id="p226-fn2" facs="#f0238-fn2"><lb n="43" facs="#f0238-l43"/>Hier ist die der Gegenwart entsprechende Ackerfläche gesetzt, die seit 1854 am Meisten <lb n="44" facs="#f0238-l44"/>im Landestheile <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName> und zwar um ca. 1000 Morgen, dagegen viel geringer in den beiden <lb n="45" facs="#f0238-l45"/>anderen Landestheilen zugenommen hat.</note></p>
</div></body></text>
